B.acO=new A.d_("Predominance Test Compliance:","Over standard match durations, RNG elements in eligible titles must never outweigh participant skill. Winners are determined by verified highest score, lowest completion time, or official round victory.",B.u,null)
B.acE=new A.d_("Zero Gambling or House Bank:","Games of chance (roulette, slots, dice, bingo, card lotteries) and house-banked odds are strictly banned. Playverzus does not act as a bookmaker or compete against players; prize pools are funded solely by participant stakes subject to disclosed fixed tier facilitation fees.",B.u,null)
